  "aiMessages": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sessionId": 1,
      "roleType": "user",
      "content": "Vue3 有哪些新特性",
      "requestSceneType": "general",
      "tokenCount": 8,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-27 14:00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sessionId": 1,
      "roleType": "assistant",
      "content": "Vue 3 的主要新特性包括：\n\n1. **Composition API** — 提供更灵活的逻辑组织和复用\n2. **更好的 TypeScript 支持**\n3. **Teleport 组件** — 将内容渲染到 DOM 中的任意位置\n4. **Fragments** — 支持多根节点组件\n5. **Suspense** — 处理异步组件加载\n6. 更小的打包体积和更好的性能",
      "requestSceneType": null,
      "tokenCount": 120,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-27 14:00:05"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sessionId": 1,
      "roleType": "user",
      "content": "能详细说说 Composition API 吗",
      "requestSceneType": "general",
      "tokenCount": 12,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "fileId": 101,
          "fileType": "image",
          "mimeType": "image/png",
          "fileUrl": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/identicon/svg?seed=ai-101"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28 09:25:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sessionId": 1,
      "roleType": "assistant",
      "content": "Composition API 是 Vue 3 的核心特性，主要包括：\n\n- **`setup()` 函数**：组件的入口点，在 beforeCreate 之前执行\n- **`ref()` 和 `reactive()`**：创建响应式数据\n- **`computed()` 和 `watch()`**：计算属性和侦听器\n- **`onMounted()` 等生命周期钩子**：按需导入\n- **自定义 Composables**：将逻辑封装为可复用函数\n\n相比 Options API，它提供了更好的代码组织、类型推导和逻辑复用能力。",
      "requestSceneType": null,
      "tokenCount": 180,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "ragReferences": [
        {
          "sourceType": "public_article",
          "sourceId": 2101,
          "entryId": 9101,
          "title": "前端 AI 请求页标准布局",
          "sourceUrl": "/articles/2101",
          "chunkIndex": 0,
          "score": 0.9132
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28 09:25:08"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sessionId": 2,
      "roleType": "user",
      "content": "TypeScript 中 type 和 interface 有什么区别",
      "requestSceneType": "general",
      "tokenCount": 15,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28 08:00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sessionId": 2,
      "roleType": "assistant",
      "content": "`type` 和 `interface` 的主要区别：\n\n1. **扩展方式**：interface 用 `extends`，type 用交叉类型 `&`\n2. **声明合并**：interface 支持同名自动合并，type 不支持\n3. **类型能力**：type 可以表示联合类型、元组、基本类型别名等\n4. **使用建议**：定义对象结构用 interface，其他场景用 type",
      "requestSceneType": null,
      "tokenCount": 150,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28 08:00:06"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sessionId": 3,
      "roleType": "user",
      "content": "帮我审查这段代码的性能问题",
      "requestSceneType": "article",
      "tokenCount": 10,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28 10:30:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sessionId": 3,
      "roleType": "assistant",
      "content": "请提供需要审查的代码片段，我会从以下方面帮你分析：\n\n1. 算法时间复杂度\n2. 内存使用效率\n3. 潜在的性能瓶颈\n4. 改进建议",
      "requestSceneType": null,
      "tokenCount": 80,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-28 10:30:04"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sessionId": 4,
      "roleType": "user",
      "content": "React 和 Vue 哪个好",
      "requestSceneType": "general",
      "tokenCount": 8,
      "responseStatus": 1,
      "errorMessage": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-27 15:00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
